    <briefdescription>
<para>Indicates that the controller completed the CS handover procedure because synchronization was lost or the configured maximum procedure count was reached. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When this event is sent, the configured CS parameters are removed and the associated connection analyzer handle is deallocated. This event is intended for the CS Follower role. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
